# tests/size/size_term.rxt — [ART-SIZE] the size term's own answer cells.
#
# Three things are pinned here, and each is a pattern whose ANSWER a bug in
# the size term would change. Everything structural (the stamps, the caps,
# cap-rescue) lives in tests/codegen/run_size_term.sh; this file is only for
# what a MATCH would notice.
#
# EVERY EXPECTATION BELOW IS ORACLE-VERIFIED against python3 `re` (the base
# tier's oracle, CLAUDE.md's rule) — the first draft of the second block was
# hand-guessed and was wrong on `"b"` (0 0 rather than 0 1 with its groups),
# which is the whole reason the convention exists.
#
# THE FIRST BLOCK IS r40 R1'S WITNESS AND IT IS THE MOST IMPORTANT CELL IN
# THE ROW. Under `--engine=vm` this pattern compiles at K=8 (118,098 emitted
# nodes) and REFUSES at K=6 with "VM exceeds 131072 emitted nodes". The size
# term evaluates a ladder of K values, so if a ladder attempt's refusal were
# ever allowed to escape — which is exactly what the design's first draft
# specified, before `ctx_fail` turned out to be a `longjmp` to the compiler's
# single recovery point — this pattern would REFUSE after the change, citing
# a limit its own artifact never reaches, at a K the caller never asked for.
# A cell here that simply MATCHES is the regression test for that: it can only
# pass if the trial's failure was discarded at the recovery point.
#
# `engine vm` is REQUIRED here and is not a convenience. On the default axis
# this pattern refuses much earlier, at NFA construction ("NFA exceeds 131072
# states") — a pre-existing limit that has nothing to do with the size term,
# and a cell that refused for THAT reason would pass whether or not the ladder
# leaked a trial's failure. Forcing the VM engine skips the NFA build and puts
# the pattern exactly where the property under test lives. (Found by writing
# the cell without it and watching it fail for the wrong reason.)

pattern (?:(?:(?:(?:(?:(?:a|b){41}){41}){41}){41}){41}){41}
engine vm
n ""
n "c"

# The nested-repeat family the size term actually SELECTS on (it takes K=1
# here, 288,314 bytes down to 60,902). Answers must not move: K is the counter
# rung's chunking factor, so the span and the captures are identical at every
# K and this block is what says so on a pattern where the term really fires.
pattern ((?:(?:(?:[^a]{1,2}|[^a]??|.{0,2}?)+){0,8}(){2,3}){1,2}){2,3}
m "" 0 0
g 1 0 0
g 2 0 0
m "b" 0 1
g 1 1 1
g 2 1 1
m "ab" 0 0
g 1 0 0
g 2 0 0

# A counter-rung pattern the term declines (its bar says the saving is not
# worth the throughput). Same requirement, opposite path: the answers here are
# produced by the DEFAULT K, and they must equal what every other K gives.
pattern ((a)|ab){0,12}c
n ""
m "c" 0 1
g 1 -1 -1
g 2 -1 -1
m "aac" 0 3
g 1 1 2
g 2 1 2
m "abababc" 0 7
g 1 4 6
g 2 -1 -1
